              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "robinnroger"
            },
            "reviewBody": "wow this was good, my man loved it. i did not add the hot curry though. i used a jar of harry and david fall harvest chutney, then i put the mixture over a bead of fetucini to make it go farther for a complete meal. yum it was great"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tammy Lynn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was easy to cook. I took the chicken out, sautéed the peppers in the pan, then added the curry powder and chutney. Then I added the chicken back in. It is very sweet, but I liked the sweet and spicy together. Very good on rice. I bought limes just for this, and I forgot to use them! Oh well. We will make this again!",
            "datePublished": "2023-03-09T15:14:34.271Z"
          },
